==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] (400%) spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] (400%) spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[B.B.Bunny]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] (400%) spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**5 [[Hater]]s spawn, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is fairly easy compared to most of the other Collab. event stages so this shouldn't be a problem unless your cats are underleveled. [[True Form]]s for some [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] are recommended like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon]] and/or [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]] to make the job easier when fighting this stage. [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Rocker Cat]] is advised because of his high health but you don't need any [[:Category:Gacha Cats|gacha cats]] to beat this. If you are a beginner, this level may be slightly challenging.

